---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import HeroSection from "../components/home/HeroSection.astro";
import HoldDemo from "../components/home/HoldDemo.astro";
---
<BaseLayout>
  <HeroSection />
  <HoldDemo />

  <section id="how-it-works" class="intro-section section">
    <div class="container intro-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">A DIFFERENT KIND OF TOOL</p>
        <h2 class="display-heading">Not just a blocker.<br /><span>A way to move forward.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="intro-copy">
        <p>Nūr is being built to help you protect your attention, make more intentional choices, recover from difficult moments and grow in ways that matter to you.</p>
        <p class="muted">There is no perfect streak to maintain and no single path you have to follow. Start with what helps. Build from there.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="features" class="feature-teaser section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">ONE SYSTEM. DIFFERENT KINDS OF SUPPORT.</p>
      <h2 class="display-heading">Make space for what matters.</h2>
      <p class="feature-intro">Protection, focus, recovery and reflection belong in the same conversation.</p>
      <div class="feature-list">
        <article class="glass-panel feature-item">
          <span class="feature-number">01</span>
          <div><h3>Protect your attention</h3><p>Create stronger boundaries around the things that pull you away from what matters.</p></div>
        </article>
        <article class="glass-panel feature-item">
          <span class="feature-number">02</span>
          <div><h3>Choose your next action</h3><p>Set an intention and give your attention somewhere meaningful to go.</p></div>
        </article>
        <article class="glass-panel feature-item">
          <span class="feature-number">03</span>
          <div><h3>Recover without shame</h3><p>A difficult moment does not have to decide what happens next.</p></div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="availability-note">Some features are still being developed and tested. Availability may vary during the closed alpha.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="our-approach" class="approach-section section">
    <div class="container approach-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">GROWTH, ON YOUR TERMS</p>
      <h2 class="display-heading">Progress without pressure.</h2>
      <p>Nūr is designed around privacy, honest support and user-controlled growth. It should help you make choices—not make choices for you.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="#how-it-works">Explore the Nūr approach <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .intro-section { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .intro-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem); align-items: start; }
  .intro-grid h2, .feature-teaser h2, .approach-inner h2 {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.25rem);
  }
  .intro-grid h2 span { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .intro-copy { max-width: 540px; padding-top: 1.2rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .intro-copy p:first-child { margin-top: 0; color: var(--color-text); }
  .feature-teaser { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-surface) 42%, transparent); }
  .feature-intro { max-width: 560px; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .feature-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  .feature-item { min-height: 220px; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-card); }
  .feature-number { color: var(--color-accent); font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .feature-item h3 { margin: 2.5rem 0 .5rem; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.65rem; font-weight: 400; }
  .feature-item p { margin: 0; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: .9rem; }
  .availability-note { margin: 1.25rem 0 0; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: .8rem; }
  .approach-section { text-align: center; }
  .approach-inner { max-width: 760px; }
  .approach-inner > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 620px; margin: 1.25rem auto; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .text-link { display: inline-flex; gap: .5rem; margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--color-accent); font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  .text-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: .25rem; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .intro-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .intro-copy { padding-top: 0; }
    .feature-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .feature-item { min-height: 175px; }
    .feature-item h3 { margin-top: 1.75rem; }
  }
</style>
